WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:06.400
Hey, love

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:08.800
Do you wanna a lift?

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:11.200
Oh, you sure?

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:12.900
Yeah. Just jump in.

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:27.200
You are a ready little liar, eh?

00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:31.300
Your mum wouldn't let you out, so you snuck out didn't you.

00:00:32.900 --> 00:00:35.200
She's probably not even looking for ya.

00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:39.600
You think she's prettier than me.

00:00:40.900 --> 00:00:42.500
Come one Evie.

00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:44.400
You're my queen.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:49.200
I'd die without you.

00:00:55.300 --> 00:00:56.600
He doesn't loved you.

00:00:59.800 --> 00:01:01.700
He just uses you.

00:01:05.600 --> 00:01:07.200
We usually do it together.

00:01:08.900 --> 00:01:11.200
There is just something about you.

00:01:14.700 --> 00:01:16.400
That makes me want you all to myself.

00:01:22.500 --> 00:01:23.500
Now let's go in there

00:01:26.700 --> 00:01:27.500
and have a little bit of fun.

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:34.500
(girl screaming)

